* **Porosity Model:** `{{ poro_params.method_name }}` with light-hydrocarbon invasion fluid correction and clay-bound water ($CBW$) partitioning.
* **Core-to-Log Calibration Masking:** Total RCA core plugs loaded in project $= {{ poro_params.total_core_count }}$; valid target-zone plugs (`{{ target_zones|join(', ') }}`) with overlapping log porosity (`~np.isnan(CPORE) & ~np.isnan(PHIT)`) used in regression $= {{ poro_params.core_count }}$.

